<title>FRANCE: Casino buys 2.49 mln of its shares.</title>
<headline>Casino buys 2.49 mln of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer Casino said it purchased 2.49 million of its ordinary shares on Friday to meet the needs of employee share schemes.</p>
<p>&quot;Following this transaction, Casino has sufficient shares to fulfill various employee share option plans set for the next 12 months,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for Casino said the purchase was carried out off-market just before the bourse close at 1500 GMT. She declined to identify the seller.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
